  "description": "This Design and Access Statement has been prepared in support of a full planning application for the conversion of the existing loft space at 22 Cheneys Road, London, E11 3LN. The application seeks consent for the erection of a rear dormer window extension and over the main rear outrigger and principal rear elevation, together with a modest increase in roof pitch to achieve the necessary internal head height at ridge level. The eaves height will remain unaltered, ensuring the streetscape and front elevation appearance are largely unaffected. The revised pitch will result in a slightly higher ridge, consistent with the approach taken on comparable properties within the area.\n\nThe statement sets out the design rationale for the proposed development, demonstrates how the proposal responds to its context, and explains how access considerations have been addressed.\n",
